settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Does the compact design affect performance?","text":"<p>No, the compact design actually improves usability by <strong>reducing power consumption<\/strong> and making the unit easier to handle, without compromising image quality or reliability.<\/p>"}},"question_pQerKy":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can it be used for long-term projects or continuous monitoring?","text":"<p>Yes, thanks to its <strong>low power consumption and durable uncooled design<\/strong>, it is suitable for extended use in both research and educational environments.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_4KNXwC","question_jRpfVg","question_6Dcapi","question_ayd7aw","question_ncJ6rQ","question_HafWat","question_pQerKy"],"name":"Collapsible content","settings":{"heading":"ThermalSense FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"1","full_width":true}},"recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"heading":"You may also like","heading_align":"text-start","layout":"carousel","card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"small","products_to_show":4}}},"order":["main","details","1709104364c0d40924","product_comparison_grid_UpRpHy","image_banner_DyTaQa","multi_column_qyRX34","media_grid_dkLe8E","multi_column_F97ChM","faq_zqjTpk","recommendations"]}